{"id":"17609071c29806304025c472aee35f760fe5600b","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234833","title":"大家在什么场景下还打算使用涨价后的 DeepSeek？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"yyws2012","excerpt":"程序员 - @yyws2012 - 单论 API 价格，GPT 5.6 luna 的价格整体比 DeepSeek v4 flash 波峰便宜、波谷贵，同时性能上还有优势并支持多模态。同时 GPT 有比例非常夸张的订阅，20 刀的","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>单论 API 价格，GPT 5.6 luna 的价格整体比 DeepSeek v4 flash 波峰便宜、波谷贵，同时性能上还有优势并支持多模态。</p><p>同时 GPT 有比例非常夸张的订阅，20 刀的 plus 如果个人只用 luna ，几乎不可能用完，而 DeepSeek 完全找不到有类似性价比的订阅。</p><p>现在 DeepSeek 剩下的优势区间大概是企业用户（无法使用订阅）+ 波谷时段？</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17979779\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dd11/c334/530209_normal.png?m=1776775505\" alt=\"kkocdko\" data-uid=\"530209\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kkocdko\">kkocdko</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 03:25:22 +08:00\">22h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>还有我们 opencode go 用户，只要能用，就一直用下去。价格似乎没有波动。</p><p>对于功能来说，做逆向的时候，gpt 、gemini 、claude 系都经常触发拒绝，而且据传（我也不确定）有封号风险。之前用过 MiMo ，经常流口水。DeepSeek-V4-Flash(low) 情况要好很多。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17979801\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4ff86c8fcdbdbe208baf81d759d4d138?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"theguagua\" data-uid=\"583774\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/theguagua\">theguagua</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 06:13:55 +08:00\">19h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公司报销场景，反正自己用是不能一天再像昨天一样蹬七个多亿 token 了...昨天 20r 不到，现在算了下得 70 起步</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17979829\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4676b54daa0f44b885474248e64b6972?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ntdll\" data-uid=\"148771\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ntdll\">ntdll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 08:00:51 +08:00\">18h 9m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>如果是公司给报销的话，deepseek 仍然是性价比之选，毕竟哥们能开发票。GPT 要走报销流程，那可麻烦多了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17979866\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/756b/7e38/16572_normal.png?m=1776818885\" alt=\"cat9life\" data-uid=\"16572\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cat9life\">cat9life</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 08:32:27 +08:00\">17h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我倒是赞同 op 的观点。除非 luna 也降智或者缩水了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17979912\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e2b1/4142/483358_normal.png?m=1739935514\" alt=\"seedhk\" data-uid=\"483358\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/seedhk\">seedhk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 08:48:20 +08:00\">17h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那现在还有量大管饱又不至于太弱智的 ai 推荐吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17979944\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e8fd/8801/595319_normal.png?m=1700048706\" alt=\"MFWT\" data-uid=\"595319\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MFWT\">MFWT</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 08:55:22 +08:00\">17h 14m ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>非生产力，少量请求的情况下，还是 API 划算（我是学生，几乎无收入）。</p><p>订阅的话，不管用不用每个月还是要交订阅费的，比如我订一个 20 刀，那我每个月都要交 20 刀。然而实际上经过估算之后，即使是涨价，我一个月的用量也可能超不过 20 块，也就是虽然看起来单价是比 20 刀订阅要高，但总价还是要低的，这个情况下还是官 API 按量计费比较好了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17979954\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e8fd/8801/595319_normal.png?m=1700048706\" alt=\"MFWT\" data-uid=\"595319\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MFWT\">MFWT</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 08:58:31 +08:00\">17h 11m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>当然，也可能会优先考虑用前两天站长搞的免费 dsv4f ，虽然额度小，但好歹也能用一点</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980062\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5ad6833c22528a55c40417f5e3561d5d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jixule\" data-uid=\"363748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jixule\">jixule</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 09:16:04 +08:00\">16h 54m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>一般问题用 opencode free ，其他的 5.6 ，收费的等梁子下次飞升成圣再接着用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980495\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a087/1963/186098_normal.png?m=1646968527\" alt=\"xooass\" data-uid=\"186098\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xooass\">xooass</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:03:51 +08:00\">16h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>因为半年前充的 100 块还没用完</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980746\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/05caf6edb254e878d2f749131b478956?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"280303\" data-uid=\"299725\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/280303\">280303</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:27:56 +08:00\">15h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一个做的一个 tg 频道，还在用 不想改了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980773\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d6ca/4972/312242_normal.png?m=1780449117\" alt=\"Sezxy\" data-uid=\"312242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sezxy\">Sezxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:32:09 +08:00\">15h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>luna max 太慢，刚刚试试了 dsv4f ，182token/s 的速度几分钟就处理完一个问题<br>另外一些爬虫、安全问题 codex 经常拒绝，还会担心触发 cyber abuse 。</p><p>所以：<br>1. 小问题要求快速处理<br>2. 安全问题</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980805\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e9d3/e7e3/79054_normal.png?m=1605146942\" alt=\"nextone\" data-uid=\"79054\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nextone\">nextone</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:34:58 +08:00\">15h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>DeepSeek 缓存命中涨的太狠了，pro 模型高峰期涨了 12 倍。用不起了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980982\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11ff/16f4/165633_normal.png?m=1685683440\" alt=\"molezznet\" data-uid=\"165633\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/molezznet\">molezznet</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:55:49 +08:00\">15h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>官方的已经退款啦， 先用第三方中转的比较划算啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981605\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5987/bc50/78391_normal.png?m=1782750130\" alt=\"yidinghe\" data-uid=\"78391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidinghe\">yidinghe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 12:12:57 +08:00\">13h 57m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那还用说吗？肯定是其他家都用不了的时候啊。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981874\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8cb9/28e6/124590_normal.png?m=1539075573\" alt=\"maemolee\" data-uid=\"124590\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maemolee\">maemolee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 13:23:23 +08:00\">12h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>deepseek 我一直是纯文本处理任务的时候，按量付费调 API ，不用它编码，缓存利用率几乎为 0😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981885\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8553/adf9/10426_normal.png?m=1688377906\" alt=\"tf2\" data-uid=\"10426\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tf2\">tf2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 13:27:14 +08:00\">12h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5 刀订阅+5 刀邀请的情况下。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981897\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bc701b234207c95ac91867210a206e5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xiaomushen\" data-uid=\"540189\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaomushen\">xiaomushen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 13:30:21 +08:00\">12h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>等公司月低消 6 万美刀的 bedrock 不能用的时候</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981902\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aea6/b4c8/349746_normal.png?m=1721637394\" alt=\"yekern\" data-uid=\"349746\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yekern\">yekern</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 13:31:03 +08:00\">12h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我们估计依然是 deepseek 之前 cursor 团队账单 任务量不大 一个月 2000+ 刀, 后来开发工作量上来了 一个月 接近 3000 刀打不住, 然后就全员切换到 deepseek 了 一个月基本 1500~2000 RMB , 最近涨价我们工作量回落了 基本也能维持估计 2000 左右,对比 cursor 还是便宜很多, 保留了 2 个 20 刀订阅的账号 处理复杂问题的是时候用 cursor,我们都是公司统一购买 开发啥都不用管 使劲蹬就行了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    